  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_6745.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El bou Fosforero, patrocinat per la Comissi&oacute; de Festes 2013 de Suera, va confirmar de nit a l&#39;embolada les <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=48808\" target=\"_blank\">expectatives que va al&ccedil;ar de vesprada quan va donar un gran esglai</a>. Pr&agrave;cticament del pil&oacute; va passar a una i altra barrera, que va colpejar amb for&ccedil;a.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousnitfestesestiusuera14/img_6696.jpg\" alt=\"img_6696\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousnitfestesestiusuera14/img_6704.jpg\" alt=\"img_6704\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousnitfestesestiusuera14/img_6705.jpg\" alt=\"img_6705\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousnitfestesestiusuera14/img_6706.jpg\" alt=\"img_6706\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousnitfestesestiusuera14/img_6707.jpg\" alt=\"img_6707\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousnitfestesestiusuera14/img_6708.jpg\" alt=\"img_6708\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousnitfestesestiusuera14/img_6709.jpg\" alt=\"img_6709\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousnitfestesestiusuera14/img_6710.jpg\" alt=\"img_6710\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/di